## Result

Both exact sources wake a fresh real Claude seat from one identical 158-byte
DM sent via the app's public ctl path, with no operator prompt or PTY input.
The seat replies with SABLE-WAKE-CONTROL, exact reply_to, its own seat ID,
and destination operator/inbox. A native-written receipt remains only a
transport observation; the separate correlated inbox reply establishes the
model/tool result.

