## Mechanism pointers

At aea0fd6a, crates/bbt-mux/src/adapters/mod.rs:97 selects oracle for Claude;
crates/bbt-mux/src/logic.rs:3810 constructs ROLE: ORACLE in prepare_gui_spawn,
and crates/bbt-mux/src/adapters/launch.rs:185 passes --append-system-prompt. The compared native.rs, hook.rs, seat_socket.rs
and app ctl.rs blobs are byte-identical between the two sources (git diff
--name-only for these paths returns no lines). Thus this result verifies
the asked short-message control, not the original long-first case.

Next decision remains with the Oracle: whether to reproduce the exact
long-first sequence or disposition the original observation another way.
